    "grok": "grok-4 / grok-4.1 / grok-4.1-fast / grok-3 not on xAI pricing as of 2026-10-12. Current: 4.3 (fast and balanced, SC1b), 4.6 (flagship). Context windows not re-modelled (page lists 4.3 at 1M).",
    "caching": "cached_input_price_per_1m modelled for Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, DeepSeek, Grok and qwen-max. Mistral (Small 4 0.015, Large 3 0.05) and qwen-flash/qwen-plus (implicit cache 20% of input) offer cache but are not modelled here - they bill cache tokens at the full input rate (never advantaged). Backlog.",
    "deepseek": "Encoded at OFF-PEAK rates. DeepSeek bills peak hours (01:00-04:00 & 06:00-10:00 UTC, Mon-Fri) at ~2x. deepseek-chat/deepseek-reasoner aliases retired 2026-07-24; now deepseek-v4-flash / deepseek-v4-pro. SC4 to model time-of-day.",
    "qwen": "Encoded at International (Singapore) endpoint rates. Same model differs by region (Beijing/Tokyo/Frankfurt/Virginia). qwen-turbo deprecated -> qwen-flash. SC4 to model region.",
    "long_context": "Gemini, Anthropic, Grok, and OpenAI flagships apply a higher meter above ~200K tokens (often ~2x). Table encodes STANDARD-context rates. SC4 to model the cliff.",
    "openai_residency": "OpenAI adds a 10% data-residency uplift on regional endpoints for models released on/after 2026-03-05. Table encodes standard (non-regional) rates. SC4.",
    "openai_lifecycle": "gpt-4o-mini, gpt-4o and o3 kept by decision (SC1b) and priced from their model pages; they are no longer on OpenAI's pricing table. o3 page marks it Deprecated (succeeded by GPT-5); snapshot gpt-4o-2024-05-13 shuts down 2026-10-23, o3-2025-04-16 on 2026-12-11. OpenAI migration is a separate backlog item.",
    "qwen_plus_mode": "qwen-plus output encoded at NON-THINKING rate (1.2, API default). Thinking mode bills 4.0. SC1b decision."
  },
